                "caption": "Figure 7:Failure modes on the threeM⁡(1)M(1)tasks.Representative paired rollouts show the same seed as task-relevant information becomes hidden and the policies reach the ambiguous decision. The blue trajectory corresponds toMemBodiedand the grey trajectory toπ0\\pi_{0}-Stateless. Bars summarise the annotated failure mode across rollouts, with marginal 95% Wilson confidence intervals. Put Back Block and Swap Blocks use all 50 rollouts per policy; Rearrange Blocks is conditioned on rollouts in which a block is moved (50 forMemBodied, 40 forπ0\\pi_{0}-Stateless). Thepp-values shown in the figure are Holm-corrected.",
