                "caption": "Figure 8:Failure modes on the twoM⁡(n)M(n)tasks.Representative paired rollouts show decisions that depend on the outcome of an earlier attempt. The blue trajectory corresponds toMemBodiedand the grey trajectory toπ0\\pi_{0}-Stateless. Bars report the conditional failure rate with marginal 95% Wilson confidence intervals: unresolved retries among rollouts that seat both batteries (23 forMemBodied, 20 forπ0\\pi_{0}-Stateless), and unverified arrangements among rollouts that complete a rearrangement (38 and 40, respectively). Thepp-values shown in the figure are Holm-corrected.",
